  "add_paragraph": [
    "Katherine joined the lab in 2018 from the University of British Columbia. She works on the fungal networks that thread through alpine soils — how they trade nutrients with plants, and what happens to that trade when the ground thaws earlier each year.",
    "She keeps the lab's ==soil core archive==: more than nine thousand cores, dried, catalogued and open to any group that wants to ask them a new question.",
    "Much of her work is done at the bench, but she still runs the autumn coring campaign herself — 'the archive is only as good as the day it was cut', as she puts it."
  ],
